-- 49 of 2025's 81 Club Sectionals were never in usau_events. ultirzr lists
-- them but carries no divisions or games for any of them, so the ultirzr
-- ingest skipped them silently. Slugs come from the event names and were each
-- verified 200 against USAU (probe-url, 2026-09-24); dates/city/state are from
-- USAU's event page. usau_event_id = the ultirzr/USAU EventId, like the 32
-- existing 2025 Sectionals rows. Teams, games and rosters are then loaded
-- per event (USAU Backfill Runbook stages 0-2).
on conflict (usau_slug) do nothing;
